{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51183","headline":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 二 · 王梵志","name":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兀然无一事，何曾有人唤。\n向外觅功夫，总是痴顽汉。\n粮不畜一粒，逢饭便知{吗灬=廾}。\n世间多事人，相趁浑不反。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}